  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Guild of Harwich Artists Annual ‘Make-it-Take-it’ Event</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">September 16, 2023 @ 10:00 am</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">4:00 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>The <strong>Guild of Harwich Artists Annual ‘Make-it-Take-it’</strong> event will be held <strong>Saturday, September 16th at the Harwich Community Center</strong> as part of the Harwich Cranberry Arts and Crafts Festival.  Guild artists are stationed around the room and will provide supplies for folks to try their hand at various painting/crafts.  What you make you take home. The popular event is free and open to the public of all ages.  This event is make possible through a generous grant from the Harwich Cultural Council.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-6590 alignleft\" src=\"/media/archive/3c636a973e4e48c578ed7548e70eac07e21708982455f8eb2e23df071522c524.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6591\" src=\"/media/archive/8ccd183f46a247b16929790dece6160eb7eb5e76706ecb07a83bb621ac1a818d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6592\" src=\"/media/archive/17654ec9964cc9966062707fd04be3dc2c18ae99e245d2cd45a2fd35823cdf63.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6594\" src=\"/media/archive/2c38a372a9a2eccdf40a99fe65b3a54557c0aad1fc9a79c73e93dc0f72d14b76.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" /> <im